#. inDungeon
msgctxt "615004"
msgid "!rmap>#00000000"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615508"
msgid "That's―――\nI-it was YOUR fault for spacing out!\nYou even had your #C000246204SG#CDEF taken…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615880"
msgid "While #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF pumps her fists excitedly,\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF shakes his head in disbelief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615992"
msgid "His eyes turn to the table draped in a white cloth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616048"
msgid "…so, the amazing strategy you came up with\nis this food?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616560"
msgid "But, I guess……\nHmm………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616812"
msgid "Oh? Interested in my sample, are we?\nWell, I didn't make it for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617096"
msgid "EAT. UP.\nI'll make roasted mince meat out of you\notherwise!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617232"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF takes a fork in hand and faces the meal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617484"
msgid "*gulp*――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617500"
msgid "BLARGHHHHHHHH!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617540"
msgid "Waaaahhh!!!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617668"
msgid "Whaaa!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617680"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF―is #C236196003Shinji#CDEF alright!!!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618168"
msgid "This'll blow #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF's stomach sky-high\nbefore Charm kicks in―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618956"
msgid "No, they've come to us.\nHurry and fix yourself up.\nIt's basic manners."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619232"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619440"
msgid "Come now, first is the morning table.\nFollow me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620076"
msgid "Welcome to the first table: morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620340"
msgid "Ermm, is this… spaghetti?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620840"
msgid "In any case, the hell tour is taking off.\nFocus, Master.\nRemember #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's advice."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "621336"
msgid "Elizabeth, we know what you're scheming!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "621380"
msgid "Eating that won't end well, will it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621424"
msgid "Huh…? Wha―no way!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621452"
msgid "………*sigh*."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622276"
msgid "I'm breaking off your lifeline."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622308"
msgid "Sorry, I'M SORRY! Anything but that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622992"
msgid "STOPPP! You think my Darling is going to be\nfed on some other woman's cooking!?\nI. SHALL. EAT."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623196"
msgid "Gah, that's…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623880"
msgid "This time, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF snaps her finger at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624020"
msgid "I guess… I have to eat…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624128"
msgid "This should be fine. It looks alright.\nDoesn't smell off. Maybe #C236196003Shinji#CDEF just has bad taste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624284"
msgid "It's fine… it's fine…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624308"
msgid "――――――!!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625412"
msgid "It just tasted like chaos."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625756"
msgid "I'll be blunt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626016"
msgid "Wh… what did you say…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626828"
msgid "Ah―Hey! Wait up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628188"
msgid "Ta-da!\nEnjoy this special stew I painstakingly,\nslowly simmered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628260"
msgid "I call it:\n\"Bon Voyage to the Blood Red Sea\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628308"
msgid "There's a crimson stew served in this deep bowl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628368"
msgid "As usual, it looks fine…\nbut that no longer offers me any solace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628696"
msgid "Hmmmm, how soooo?\nThat's just how it came. Yep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629068"
msgid "…………!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629084"
msgid "Suddenly, our eyes meet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629112"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF grips the hem of her skirt,\nlooking like she's about to cry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629396"
msgid "No! No, no! I don't want it to get thrown away!\nDo that, and I PROMISE I won't open that door!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629604"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629736"
msgid "She said that she \"painstakingly, slowly simmered\" this stew."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630352"
msgid "…#[piggy][squirrely]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630516"
msgid "――――――!!!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "630940"
msgid "Awful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631540"
msgid "I-is it…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632092"
msgid "…………hang in there, Shinji-boy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632488"
msgid "I know. But it paid off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632812"
msgid "The final round is about to start――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633196"
msgid "The night table.\nAs I imagined, the table is\ncrammed with an exorbitant amount of food."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634076"
msgid "…sure, we can easily open that door if we use\nthe unarmed Shinji-boy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635104"
msgid "But as a Servant, I can't idly watch by as my\nMaster's stomach gets destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635652"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF…\nThanks. Your sympathy helps steady my nerves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635788"
msgid "This food was prepared by #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF for #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636000"
msgid "This food was prepared by #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF for #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636492"
msgid "F-f-f-for REALLLL!!??\nThere it is! The marriage proposal!\nI'm holding you to it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636764"
msgid "―――A-alright. Here I go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636856"
msgid "I glance at #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF, who's staring at me\nintently and paying no heed to #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's uproar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637008"
msgid "Yes… Help yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637100"
msgid "Hey! That single bite did a ton of\ndamage to you!\nAre you really going to be alright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637912"
msgid "Why is it so… so red…?\nPut a little green in it or something!\nThat's what I would do!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638112"
msgid "YOU'RE too calm, #C236196003Rani#CDEF!\nPlease stop #[him][her]#!\nI can't bear to watch this…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639176"
msgid "That was a really fun idea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639332"
msgid "\"Want to try it then?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639364"
msgid "#[Yep][Mhm]#, I want some.\nBut my belly is filled with enough chaos\nas it is, so―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639452"
msgid "\"No worries. My curry is excellent.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639496"
msgid "#C080080080Within my wandering mind,#CDEF\n#C236196003Julius#CDEF#C080080080 and #CDEF#C236196003Leo#CDEF#C080080080 present curry to me while smiling.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639796"
msgid "Master! Get a grip on yourself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639828"
msgid "Darling! Please come back to us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639912"
msgid "――――Oh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640552"
msgid "Woah! You ate it all!\nAnd the doors are fully open!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640680"
msgid "………how did you find the taste?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640784"
msgid "This is what I have to say―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "640824"
msgid "It was very delicious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641044"
msgid "I hastily add:\n\"The food you made for me satisfied my heart\nalong with my stomach.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641220"
msgid "That said―――I know perfectly well how much\nshe toiled to prepare all this food for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641328"
msgid "\"It tasted bad. Thank you,\" I tell her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641376"
msgid "――――――!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641452"
msgid "So he ran?\nNo matter. The end is nigh anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641968"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF absentmindedly watches her own body deteriorate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642248"
msgid "Livestock, other nobles, they'd all praise me.\nWell, I did hang anyone who didn't, but――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642608"
msgid "Really stunning work today, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nI kind of feel full myself…"
msgstr ""

